# Lumberyard: makes fuel (wood) from the trees within the harvest radius around it. It stands anywhere: its yield
# follows what stands around it. No field, no light use. A 4x4x4 m box (2x2 cells). Spawned origin 2.0 above ground.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a TIMBER YARD - a plank floor (the root), a pile
# of LOGS (pillars turned on their side: three below, two on top), a saw shed with a dark roof in a corner, and a
# bundle of trunks that stands upright beside it. The child pieces are render-only.
